<Defs>
  <ThingDef ParentName="YR_BondageBedBase">
    <defName>YR_Building_LoveRoom</defName>
    <label>love room</label>
    <description>A plant capable of giving pleasure of treading the border of life and death to its captive by nearly drowning them in honey. \n\nPain experienced by the "prey" also brought great pleasure to the plant itself, so it keeps them alive by using restorative honey.\n\nHoney secreted to engulf the victims will slowly turn purple in color as it mixes with the bodily fluids released by the prey in both pain and pleasure. It is possible to relive the prey's memory by consuming this altered honey.</description>
